Package: HGGAdvancesNBSAnalysis
Type: Project
Title: Reproducible Analysis of PRE, GIA, and Newborn Screening
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Manuscript", "Authors", role = "aut")
Description: Analysis code supporting the manuscript comparison of
    parent-reported ethnicity, genetically inferred ancestry, and
    random-forest classification of methylmalonic acidemia screen-positive
    newborns. Raw participant-level data are not distributed.
